...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
adk_web: adk web 서버 { class: ext }
agent: 컨설턴트 에이전트 (root_agent) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }
perplexity: Perplexity API (sonar) { class: ext }

user -> adk_web: 질문 텍스트 (POST /run)
adk_web -> agent: 임포트해 둔 root_agent 조회
agent -> gemini: instruction + 도구 선언 + 질문
gemini -> agent: function_call: perplexity_search(query)
agent -> perplexity: POST 요청
perplexity -> agent: JSON 응답
agent -> gemini: function_response 전달
